@startuml Header_Dependencies

' ---- simple, portable styling ----
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #2F3B4A
skinparam RoundCorner 12
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #6b7280

' ---- color palette ----
!define C_API     #e6f3ff
!define C_CORE    #e8f5e8
!define C_STRUCT  #fff3cd

' ---- diagram ----
rectangle "memory_manager_api.h\n(PUBLIC API)" as A C_API
rectangle "memory_manager.h\n(INTERNAL)" as B C_CORE
rectangle "glthread.h\n(DATA STRUCTURES)" as C C_STRUCT

A -down-> B
B -down-> C

note right of A
User-facing header that defines:
• XCALLOC, XFREE macros  
• API for registering data types  
• Links to internal manager
end note

note right of B
Implements core internals:
• Page management logic  
• Block allocation & merging  
• Uses GLThread for free lists
end note

note right of C
Provides intrusive linked list macros:
• Doubly linked node handling  
• No dynamic allocation  
• Used across all modules
end note

@enduml
